Package: strandai
Type: Package
Title: Client for the Strand Platform API
Version: 0.5.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Strand AI", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "support@strandai.com"))
Description: R client for the Strand Platform 'REST' API. Provides functions to
    upload Whole Slide Images via 'GCS' resumable upload, submit 'Lattice' H&E
    to multiplex protein inference jobs, and download 'OME-Zarr' predictions as
    'SpatialExperiment' objects from Bioconductor. Designed for spatial-omics
    research workflows in pharma and academic labs.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://strandai.com, https://docs.strandai.com, https://github.com/Strand-AI/strand-sdk-r
BugReports: https://github.com/Strand-AI/strand-sdk-r/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8),
    utils
Suggests:
    SpatialExperiment,
    SummarizedExperiment,
    S4Vectors,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    webfakes,
    withr,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
